{"id":"vod_sn_36932","vodId":"36932","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"史上最强弟子兼一","name_cn":"史上最强弟子兼一","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1967502bb377ea4780bbb5062b3dcc3e.jpg"},"summary":"白滨兼一（关智一 配音）是一个为人和善性格懦弱的内向少年，因为这性格，兼一没少受同学的欺负。为了改变悲惨的现状，兼一决定改头换面重新做人，随即加入了学校的空手道部。没想到，在社团里，兼一的境遇并没有改变，因为被社员讨厌，兼一即将被驱逐出社团，唯一幸免于难的方法就是在于社员的比武中获胜，这对于兼一来说，几乎是不可能完成的任务。　　名叫风林寺美羽（川上伦子 配音）的美少女出现在了兼一的面前，她告诉兼一，有一处名为梁山泊的道场聚集了无数的武林英雄豪杰。为了赢得比试，兼一走上了修炼的修罗之道，令他没想到的是，他平凡的人生即将被这一仓促的决定而彻底颠覆。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5PMqEiMCmX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/58vwG5kq1h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iBqQpBtTQC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kwA0x1tz5Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yUu8ysvSPU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fQMJLeAXXY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QRRBVGpmm21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pn7Fjvx4Y41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S1iiPLuY511/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MkAjEEsyy31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y9Rurxxryi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jeaFAC3qi21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8th9aytVqF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f54mP5CCFi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url